{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108190","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710819001:1":{"text":"カリバーンが……聖光が……っ！","source_cn":"石中剑……圣光……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EB5143CDE086681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710819002:1":{"text":"本物だ！本物のローランド大帝だ！","source_cn":"是他！真的是他！罗兰大帝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4084228BD1A6331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710819003:1":{"text":"大帝が……大帝が戻られたのね！","source_cn":"大帝……大帝回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26209B0304ACC20E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710819004:1":{"text":"荒唐無稽な茶番ではあったが、予想外の収穫もあった。","source_cn":"这场闹剧虽然荒唐，但也有一个意外之喜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC82A192BA52D0138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710819005:1":{"text":"影に潜み、すべてを操っていた真の黒幕を、表舞台へ引きずり出せたのだからな。","source_cn":"那就是，它让那只一直藏在阴影中、操纵一切的真正黑手显形了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8122294CF8AA2421","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710819006:1":{"