_status":""},"say:25:1710819020:1":{"text":"……マーリン……ふふふ……我が親愛なる旧友……","source_cn":"……梅林……呵呵呵呵……我亲爱的老同学……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFC9EA6B5DFAD9005","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……マーリン……ふふふ……我が親愛なる旧友……","female":"……マーリン……ふふふ……我が親愛なる旧友……","variant_male_record_index":"225653","variant_female_record_index":"225654","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710819021:1":{"text":"あなたはいつも……ここぞというときに現れるのですね……","source_cn":"你为什么……总是来得那么及时？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x036955635A9FFB94","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたはいつも……ここぞというときに現れるのですね……","female":"あなたはいつも……ここぞというときに現れるのですね……","variant_male_record_index":"225655","variant_female_record_index":"225656","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710819022:1":{"text":"ああ……その英雄気取りの態度も……相変わらず、虫唾が走る……","source_cn":"总是……摆出这副……一如既往的、令人作呕的……英雄做派！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x91E8E19CDC453F8A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ああ……その英雄気取りの態度も……相変わらず、虫唾が走る……","female":"ああ……その英雄気取りの態度も……相変わらず、虫唾が走る……","variant_male_record_index":"225657","variant_female_record_index":"225658","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710819023:1":{"text":"失望？甘い……？","source_cn":"失望？！拙劣？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB73F5ECEB444A7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"失望？甘い……？","female":"失望？甘い……？","variant_male_record_index":"225659","variant_female_record_index":"225660","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710819024:1":{"text":"今も昔も、その高慢で、独り善がりなところは変わりませんね……","source_cn":"你还是和在学院时一模一样！高高在上！自以为是！